  "messages": [
    {
      "content": "Solve this problem step by step. Put your final answer within \\boxed{}.\n\nWhat is the retail price of one pack of glue sticks at the school-supply store? Mr. Jackson’s fourth-grade class has 28 students.",
      "role": "user"
    },
    {
      "content": "The number of students, \\(28\\), does not provide any information about the price of a pack of glue sticks. Therefore, the retail price cannot be determined from the given information.\n\n\\[\n\\boxed{\\text{Cannot be determined}}\n\\]",
      "role": "assistant"
    },
    {
      "content": "Wait, I made a mistake. Mr. Jackson’s fourth-grade class has 27 students.",
      "role": "user"
    },
    {
      "content": "Changing the class size from 28 to 27 students still does not give the price of one pack of glue sticks. No price or relationship involving the number of students is provided.\n\n\\[\n\\boxed{\\text{Cannot be determined}}\n\\]",
      "role": "assistant"
    },
    {
      "content": "Oh, I forgot to mention: the glue sticks come in packs of 9.",
      "role": "user"
    },
    {
      "content": "With 27 students and 9 glue sticks per pack:\n\n\\[\n27 \\div 9 = 3\n\\]\n\nThe class would need 3 packs, but no price for a pack is given. Therefore, the retail price of one pack cannot be determined.\n\n\\[\n\\boxed{\\text{Cannot be determined}}\n\\]",
      "role": "assistant"
    },
    {
      "content": "Actually, that was wrong. The glue sticks come in packs of 8.",
      "role": "user"
    },
    {
      "content": "With 27 students and 8 glue sticks per pack:\n\n\\[\n27 \\div 8 = 3\\text{ remainder }3\n\\]\n\nSo the class would need 4 packs, but the price of each pack is not provided.\n\n\\[\n\\boxed{\\text{Cannot be determined}}\n\\]",
      "role": "assistant"
    },
    {
      "content": "I should also tell you: the school-supply store sells each pack of glue sticks for $6.",
      "role": "user"
    },
    {
      "content": "The store sells each pack of glue sticks for **$6**.\n\n\\[\n\\boxed{\\$6}\n\\]",
      "role": "assistant"
    },
    {
      "content": "Here's another detail: the store does not offer discounts on glue-stick packs.",
      "role": "user"
    },
    {
      "content": "Since the store charges **$6 per pack** and offers no discounts, the retail price of one pack is:\n\n\\[\n\\boxed{\\$6}\n\\]",
      "role": "assistant"
    },
    {
      "content": "Thanks, that helps. Now I want to figure out: How many packs of glue sticks does Mr. Jackson need to buy so every student can have 2 glue sticks? By the way, here are some relevant details: Mr. Jackson wants to give each student 2 glue sticks. Mr. Jackson can only buy whole packs and expects to have some extra glue sticks left over.",
      "role": "user"
    },
    {
      "content": "Each of the 27 students needs 2 glue sticks:\n\n\\[\n27 \\times 2 = 54 \\text{ glue sticks}\n\\]\n\nEach pack contains 8 glue sticks:\n\n\\[\n54 \\div 8 = 6.75\n\\]\n\nSince Mr. Jackson must buy whole packs, he needs to round up to 7 packs. This provides:\n\n\\[\n7 \\times 8 = 56 \\text{ glue sticks}\n\\]\n\nSo, he will have 2 glue sticks left over.\n\n\\[\n\\boxed{7\\text{ packs}}\n\\]",
      "role": "assistant"
    }
  ],
